      },
      "worked": "For heads, the marbles must be $1,2,4$, in any of six orders. For tails, they must be $3,4$, in either order. Let $H$ and $T$ denote heads and tails.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}P(\\text{sum }7\\mid H)&=6\\times\\frac14\\times\\frac13\\times\\frac12=\\frac14\\\\P(\\text{sum }7\\mid T)&=2\\times\\frac14\\times\\frac13=\\frac16\\\\P(\\text{sum }7)&=\\frac12\\times\\frac14+\\frac12\\times\\frac16\\\\P(\\text{sum }7)&=\\frac{5}{24}\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
